msgid "Traditional Helicopter Aerobatic Setup"
msgstr "传统直升机特技飞行设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup.rst:7
#: de4bbdc5a9b04f3d93072d78592c537b
msgid ""
"Aerobatic operation is possible in ACRO mode. However, the normal collective"
" pitch setup of -2° to +12° will not allow inverted maneuvers. If desired, "
"the :ref:`H_COL_MAX <H_COL_MAX>` and :ref:`H_COL_MIN <H_COL_MIN>` values cam"
" be setup for -10°or 12° to +10° or +12°. Hover upright will now be between "
"center and high stick and inverted hover between center and low stick."
msgstr ""
"特技飞行可在 Acro 模式下进行。但是，-2° 到 +12° 的常规总距设置不允许倒飞机动。如需倒飞，可将 :ref:`H_COL_MAX "
"<H_COL_MAX>` 和 :ref:`H_COL_MIN <H_COL_MIN>` 值设置为 -10° 或 12° 到 +10° 或 "
"+12°。此时，正飞悬停将在中杆和高杆之间，倒飞悬停在中杆和低杆之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup.rst:9
#: e6be60aa58914ea89c86be8991b1b8b1
