#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup.rst:26
#: f0baa08202e14c43acbf442e7eed623c
msgid ""
"to provide a similar curve in STABILIZE to that of the narrower(-2° to +12°)"
" collective range and allowing spool up at low stick and no jumps from "
"STABILIZE to other modes. But ACRO will still cause a hover jump if switched"
" to another mode, so be prepared."
msgstr ""
"以在 Stabilize 模式下提供类似于较窄（-2° 到 +12°）总距范围的曲线，允许在低油门下启动，并避免从 Stabilize "
"切换到其他模式时出现突跳。但 Acro 模式切换到其他模式时仍会出现悬停突跳，请做好准备。"
